<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL-Intel up on analysts views.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL-Intel up on analysts views.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intel Corp shares traded 1-5/8 higher to 132 preceding Friday's market open, a rise traders attributed to positive comments from Wall Street securities analysts.</p>
</text>
